---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Location & Directions";
const description = "Island Goodes is located in Papaikou, just 5 minutes from downtown Hilo and 12 minutes from Hilo Airport. Adults-only accommodation, perfect base for Volcanoes National Park, Mauna Kea, and Hamakua Coast.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Location</h1>
      <p>Your perfect home base for exploring the Big Island's east side</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="location-info">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="location-grid">
        <div class="map-container">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3784.5!2d-155.0939!3d19.8075!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x0!2zMTnCsDQ4JzI3LjAiTiAxNTXCsDA1JzM4LjAiVw!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1600000000000!5m2!1sen!2sus"
            width="100%"
            height="400"
            style="border:0; border-radius: 8px;"
            allowfullscreen=""
            loading="lazy"
            title="Island Goodes location map">
          </iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="address-info">
          <h2>Getting Here</h2>
          <div class="address">
            <h3>Address</h3>
            <p>
              Island Goodes<br />
              27-2365 Hawaii Belt Rd<br />
              Papaikou, HI 96781
            </p>
            <p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=27-2365+Hawaii+Belt+Rd+Papaikou+HI+96781" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in Google Maps</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-quick">
            <h3>Contact</h3>
            <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+18089642291">808-964-2291</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="directions">
            <h3>From Hilo Airport (ITO)</h3>
            <p>Just 12 minutes / 7 miles north on Highway 19 (Hawaii Belt Road). Look for our sign on the mauka (mountain) side of the road.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="distances">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Distances to Popular Attractions</h2>
      <div class="distances-grid">
        <div class="distance-card">
          <h3>Downtown Hilo</h3>
          <p class="time">5 minutes</p>
          <p>Farmers market, restaurants, shops, Pacific Tsunami Museum, and historic downtown.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="distance-card">
          <h3>Hilo Airport (ITO)</h3>
          <p class="time">12 minutes</p>
          <p>Direct flights from Honolulu, Maui, Kauai, and seasonal mainland connections.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="distance-card">
          <h3>Rainbow Falls</h3>
          <p class="time">10 minutes</p>
          <p>Famous 80-foot waterfall, best viewed in the morning when rainbows appear in the mist.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="distance-card">
          <h3>Akaka Falls</h3>
          <p class="time">20 minutes</p>
          <p>Stunning 442-foot waterfall along the scenic Hamakua Coast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="distance-card">
          <h3>Hawaii Tropical Botanical Garden</h3>
          <p class="time">10 minutes</p>
          <p>40-acre nature preserve with over 2,000 species in a stunning valley setting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="distance-card">
          <h3>Hawaii Volcanoes National Park</h3>
          <p class="time">45 minutes</p>
          <p>See active volcanoes, lava tubes, steam vents, and the Kilauea crater.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="distance-card">
          <h3>Mauna Kea Summit</h3>
          <p class="time">1 hour</p>
          <p>World-class stargazing at 13,800 feet. Visitor center and observatory tours available.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="distance-card">
          <h3>Honoli'i Beach</h3>
          <p class="time">8 minutes</p>
          <p>Popular local surf spot with beautiful black sand beach.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-area">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>About the Hilo Area</h2>
      <div class="area-content">
        <div class="area-text">
          <p>
            The Hilo side of the Big Island offers a completely different experience from the resort areas
            of Kona. Here you'll find lush rainforests, dramatic waterfalls, black sand beaches, and an
            authentic Hawaiian town that hasn't been overrun by tourists.
          </p>
          <p>
            Hilo is the gateway to Hawaii Volcanoes National Park and Mauna Kea, two of the island's
            most spectacular attractions. The Hamakua Coast north of Hilo is one of the most scenic
            drives in Hawaii, with numerous waterfalls and tropical valleys.
          </p>
          <p>
            The town of Hilo itself has wonderful farmers markets (Wednesday and Saturday), excellent
            local restaurants, historic buildings, and a laid-back atmosphere that many visitors prefer
            to the busier tourist areas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-highlights">
          <h3>Why Stay on the Hilo Side?</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Closest accommodations to Volcanoes National Park</li>
            <li>Less crowded than Kona resort areas</li>
            <li>More affordable dining and activities</li>
            <li>Lush, tropical scenery</li>
            <li>Authentic Hawaiian culture and community</li>
            <li>World-famous farmers markets</li>
            <li>Easy access to Mauna Kea stargazing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Explore?</h2>
      <p>Book your stay at Island Goodes and discover the real Hawaii</p>
      <a href="https://v2.reservationkey.com/3655/reserve/c" class="btn btn-primary btn-large" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check Availability</a>
      <p class="cta-phone">Or call us: <a href="tel:+18089642291">808-964-2291</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.5), rgba(0,0,0,0.5)), url('/images/rooms/mauna-kea/lanai.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
    min-height: 40vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .location-info {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .location-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .address-info h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .address-info h3 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .address-info h3:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .distances {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .distances h2 {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .distances-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .distance-card {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .distance-card h3 {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .distance-card .time {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .distance-card p:last-child {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .about-area {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .about-area h2 {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .area-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .area-text p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .area-highlights {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .area-highlights h3 {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .area-highlights ul {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .area-highlights li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .area-highlights li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-secondary);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #c49943;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-large {
    padding: 1rem 3rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-primary-dark) 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .cta-section h2 {
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-section p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-phone {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-phone a {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .location-grid,
    .area-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
